# =============================================================================
# Izwi Audio - Docker build context
# =============================================================================
# An allowlist: the context holds only what the Dockerfile copies. Anything
# else in the checkout (local tools' state, task notes, models, credentials)
# never leaves the machine, whichever builder or COPY is used.

*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!ui/
!LICENSE
!NOTICE

# Inside the allowed directories: build output and local state.
**/target/
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/
ui/coverage/
ui/test-results/
ui/playwright-report/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
